WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.390
Ippo-kun, you all right?

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.910
I'm fine.

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:06.060
I can still...

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:08.700
Don't panic.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:12.540
Fists of fire and a cool head. Those are the basics.

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:13.990
The basics?

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:17.490
You need to find a way to slip through those lefts.

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:19.750
You're in control of this match.

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:24.680
However, Makunouchi is still able to stick with it, 
no matter how beaten up he looks.

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:27.250
Don't rush things, take your time, and hurt him more.

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:30.000
I don't like eating tough meat.

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:34.320
I will wait for him to slowly tenderize...

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:37.970
then devour him.

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:41.940
This is the fourth round!

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:49.280
The champion puts up a tight, peekaboo guard, swaying his body to and fro!

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:52.700
He's using his standard fighting pose here! {original - standard}

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:55.750
<i>Wave your body, get back to the basics.</i>

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:56.700
<i>The basics!</i>

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:59.110
<i>He looks composed.</i>

00:00:59.110 --> 00:01:01.710
<i>Didn't he take any damage from that last counter?</i>

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:04.200
<i>Let's feel him out.</i>

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:10.130
The champion goes in!

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:12.750
He faces a storm of Bullets!

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:13.690
But he dodges them!

00:01:13.690 --> 00:01:15.680
He pays them no attention as he inches closer!

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:17.930
His recovery speed is incredible!

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:21.940
<i>All that juking won't help you escape.</i>

00:01:27.070 --> 00:01:30.820
Whoa! He's taking some Bullets as he goes in!

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:34.480
<i>He's not even trying to get away.</i>

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:36.660
<i>Whatever he can't dodge, he blocks.</i>

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:38.370
<i>Is that why he's doing the peekaboo style?</i>

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:41.500
He's within firing range!

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:42.790
<i>Now that he's in...</i>

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:46.250
An upper! The champion switches his attack pattern!

00:01:47.470 --> 00:01:49.380
He pitches forward from that liver blow!

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:54.390
A double liver blow! But an elbow stops it!

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:57.140
<i>So it's a head shot? I gotcha—</i>

00:01:57.140 --> 00:01:58.520
<i>It was a feint?</i>

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:02.350
<i>Three body blows? He doesn't let up!</i>

00:02:03.830 --> 00:02:05.980
He throws up a right hand!

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:08.980
And another body blow just as he straightened up!

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:10.490
He barely blocks it!

00:02:10.490 --> 00:02:13.200
But you can feel that force from here!

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:15.920
The challenger fires away!

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:18.830
But he's no match against that weaving!

00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:21.290
<i>I'm dodging him!</i>

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:24.290
<i>Has Sawamura-san's left become slower?</i>

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:28.500
The champion's now weaving faster from side to side!

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:33.440
I guess all those body blows affected Sawamura's speed.

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:34.260
Miyata,

00:02:34.260 --> 00:02:39.770
Sawamura has indeed demonstrated how good he is against an infighter.

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:45.710
But textbook techniques won't be enough to stop Makunouchi right here.

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:51.280
I'm not here to see his anti-infighter techniques.

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:55.280
What I'm here to see...

00:02:56.670 --> 00:02:58.410
is his anti-Makunouchi.

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:01.270
<i>I can do this! Here goes!</i>

00:03:01.270 --> 00:03:02.910
<i>Here goes!</i>

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:07.140
His anti-Makunouchi?

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:14.770
If Makunouchi is the best infighter in the country, then Sawamura is the best counterpuncher.

00:03:15.510 --> 00:03:19.110
I don't see this match going by the books at all.

00:03:19.110 --> 00:03:20.640
But look at that.

00:03:21.020 --> 00:03:23.560
How does someone stop that?

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:28.790
Knock him down!

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:29.900
Take him out!

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:33.040
It's his for the taking, Takamura-san!

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:36.170
<i>It can't be that easy.</i>

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:41.240
<i>What face is that bastard Sawamura hiding behind those gloves?</i>

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:45.580
<i>He's strong! He really is!</i>

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:50.070
<i>But I need to hold on and bide my time.</i>

00:03:50.070 --> 00:03:54.920
<i>The longer I wait to eat, the tastier the meat.</i>

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:02.850
His back-and-forth is picking up.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:06.350
It's only a matter of time before he breaks through.

00:04:07.070 --> 00:04:08.570
No, hold on.

00:04:08.570 --> 00:04:14.110
No matter how much speed he picks up, 
those back-and-forths are just repeated motions.

00:04:14.110 --> 00:04:16.600
Repeated motions?

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:22.480
But thanks to his amazing stamina,
 Makunouchi can do that all day if he wants.

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:25.130
You can set your watch to it.

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:32.130
To any seasoned student of boxing,
 that will make for a can't-miss counter.

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:35.630
And an anti-Makunouchi will appear,

00:04:36.530 --> 00:04:39.340
when he prolongs that back-and-forth.

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:45.870
When he prolongs that back-and-forth?

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:52.860
What Sawamura's waiting for...

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:00.290
<i>is the Dempsey Roll?</i>

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:08.410
There it is! His secret weapon, the Dempsey Roll!

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:10.150
The challenger tightens his guard!

00:05:10.150 --> 00:05:13.000
But can he withstand those heavy blows?

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:24.220
<i>He stepped backwards to add some space!</i>

00:05:30.270 --> 00:05:31.900
<i>Here it is.</i>

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:35.160
<i>I've been waiting for this!</i>

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:58.670
A-A counter!

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:01.510
It's a left counter!

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:10.460
He was this close to claiming victory with his patented Dempsey Roll!

00:06:10.460 --> 00:06:14.190
The Hall is stunned! Nobody makes a sound!

00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:19.190
He grabs the ropes to avoid a down!

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:20.250
However!

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:26.660
However, there's no light in the champion's eyes!

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:27.790
He's lost his strength!

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:29.260
We can't blame him!

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:33.170
Following the Shimabukuro fight, this is the second time his Dempsey Roll has been crushed!{do you use it like this "the Shimabukuro fight" and not "the fight with Shimabukuro"?}

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:37.310
Other than that, this is a different situation here, folks!

00:06:37.310 --> 00:06:39.750
Shimabukuro paid a heavy price back then.

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:41.130
But this challenger...

00:06:41.760 --> 00:06:42.910
is unscathed!

00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:46.140
He has perfected the Dempsey Crusher!

00:06:46.890 --> 00:06:47.880
<i>He...</i>

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:50.430
<i>He's done for!</i>

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:52.940
The challenger slowly gets nearer!

00:06:52.940 --> 00:06:55.340
Can the champion hit back?

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:58.940
What's this?

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:04.280
H-He's sizing him up! He's not finishing the job!

00:07:04.280 --> 00:07:07.280
He's checking out how damaged the champion is!

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:12.010
The champion moves.

00:07:12.010 --> 00:07:13.490
But his limbs are shaking!

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:15.460
Heck, is he even conscious?

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:16.790
Hit him back!

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:17.860
Make him pay!

00:07:17.860 --> 00:07:18.960
You're fine!

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:21.250
<i>He's not fine!</i>

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:24.060
<i>The Dempsey Roll was his deadly weapon!</i>

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:26.970
<i>Yet, his body felt the entire force of his own move!</i>

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:30.470
<i>It's a miracle that he's even standing.</i>

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:34.980
The champion gathers up his strength!

00:07:36.070 --> 00:07:37.980
But his legs give out!

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:41.260
That's the end of the fourth round!

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:43.900
The champion is saved by the bell!

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:55.660
Kid!

00:07:57.950 --> 00:08:00.500
Do you hear me?! Am I getting through to you?!

00:08:00.970 --> 00:08:02.510
I-I'm not going to lose...

00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:06.010
If you're conscious, then don't talk!

00:08:06.010 --> 00:08:13.020
If I lose to a man who makes a mockery of boxing...

00:08:13.020 --> 00:08:15.810
Don't talk! Use this time to rest up!

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:19.730
I'm the champion.

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:24.050
If I lose, every boxer in Japan will be mocked.

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:26.530
I can't lose.

00:08:27.510 --> 00:08:28.780
Kid...

00:08:30.060 --> 00:08:31.910
<i>He still has his spirit.</i>

00:08:32.790 --> 00:08:39.460
<i>Even after having his Dempsey crushed and taking heavy damage, he still wants to fight.</i>

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:45.420
<i>Is he fighting this match with that amount of determination and sense of duty?</i>

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.930
He's tender now.

00:08:48.850 --> 00:08:52.470
The meat softened up after he lost his strength.

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:57.640
It was so yielding I could sink my teeth all the way through.

00:08:57.640 --> 00:09:00.480
It used to be so tough and sinewy.

00:09:04.130 --> 00:09:06.090
But now it's done.

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:11.910
That's the bell for the fifth round!

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:15.660
The champion makes his way on unsteady legs!

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:18.160
<i>I'm not going to lose!</i>

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:27.170
<i>This is incredible!</i>

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:32.640
<i>The muscles are relaxed. The sinews are loosening up, one by one!</i>

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:35.390
<i>I live for that sensation!</i>

00:09:35.390 --> 00:09:37.180
<i>It fills me up like nothing else!</i>

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:39.890
<i>Damn, you're so tasty!</i>

00:09:42.230 --> 00:09:45.230
Whoa! Another hail of Bullets!

00:09:48.110 --> 00:09:51.020
<i>Your cheek is especially tender!</i>

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:53.490
<i>Oh god, this is the best meat possible!</i>

00:09:55.490 --> 00:10:00.130
Sawamura switched{ from} using his counters to keep him at bay for{to going on} the offensive!

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:06.250
He also sped up the same Bullets Makunouchi was dodging in the last round.

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:09.210
He was slowing them down for a reason.

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:10.800
So that he could {can}dodge them.

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:14.610
Those lefts made that Dempsey Roll happen.{That Dempsey Roll was induced by those lefts.}

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:16.760
Everything was a well-laid path leading up to that counter.

00:10:17.440 --> 00:10:23.230
So those attacks from Makunouchi were all part of Sawamura's plan?

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:27.370
<i>I'm starting to drool!</i>

00:10:27.370 --> 00:10:29.780
<i>Your meat is juicy, no matter where I slice it!</i>

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:38.740
The champion fights back!

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:41.200
<i>I need to eat you whole before I'm satisfied!</i>

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:43.540
<i>I'll chew you all the way to your skull!</i>

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:47.340
A counter directly at the champion's head!

00:10:47.340 --> 00:10:50.550
Nope, he escaped it by a hair!

00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:52.260
<i>I gotta stay conscious!</i>

00:10:52.260 --> 00:10:54.800
<i>If I black out, it's all over!</i>

00:10:57.080 --> 00:11:00.850
<i>Meat from an animal with a lot of stamina is always red.</i>

00:11:00.850 --> 00:11:03.390
<i>He still has a small amount of fight left in him.</i>

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:05.510
<i>In order for meat to be tasty,</i>

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:08.770
<i>it has to be marbled with tiny specks of fat!</i>

00:11:13.050 --> 00:11:15.050
<i>This is it!</i>

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:16.960
<i>Yes!</i>

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:21.290
<i>It tastes just as good as that steak.</i>

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:22.830
<i>Give me more!</i>

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:26.600
Whoa, he's mercilessly trying to take the fight out of him!

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:28.750
The champion can't dodge him!

00:11:34.300 --> 00:11:38.060
The fifth round ends with blood spraying everywhere!

00:11:38.060 --> 00:11:40.810
The champion is once again saved by the bell!

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:46.460
Are you kidding me?

00:11:46.460 --> 00:11:47.310
This is bad.

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:51.350
I figured as much back during training.

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:53.820
But I still didn't want this to happen!

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:55.800
The worst possible outcome.

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:59.070
The anti-Makunouchi. I can only tip my hat.

00:11:59.710 --> 00:12:02.330
Miyata, is this what you wanted to see?

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:05.830
Is this what you wanted for Makunouchi?

00:12:10.090 --> 00:12:11.880
<i>H-He... He's strong.</i>

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:16.920
<i>If I don't focus on staying conscious, he'll knock me out cold.</i>

00:12:18.970 --> 00:12:20.640
<i>I can still move.</i>

00:12:21.410 --> 00:12:25.640
<i>I must take the fight to him while I'm still conscious!</i>

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:28.510
<i>Take it to him!</i>

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:30.400
<i>Just think about winning!</i>

00:12:31.190 --> 00:12:33.150
Aren't you sitting down, Sawamura?

00:12:33.150 --> 00:12:35.900
That'll only mess with my rhythm.

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:38.100
<i>It'll be like interrupting my dinner.</i>

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:39.660
<i>Start the round already!</i>

00:12:40.520 --> 00:12:42.930
<i>Look at him standing majestically.</i>

00:12:42.930 --> 00:12:43.910
<i>Do you see that, Kawabe?</i>

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:48.750
<i>The problem child you brought to me will soon become the national champ!</i>

00:12:49.670 --> 00:12:51.150
<i>Ryuuhei...</i>

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:55.510
Whoa! He rushes in at the sound of the bell!

00:12:56.190 --> 00:12:59.550
And the one rushing in
 is the severely wounded champion!

00:13:00.220 --> 00:13:02.900
A counter, followed by the Bullets!

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:05.010
The challenger isn't giving up his momentum!

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:07.020
<i>You're amazing.</i>

00:13:07.450 --> 00:13:10.730
<i>I heard Makunouchi-san is a very tough champion.</i>

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:13.020
<i>I thought even you were no match for him.</i>

00:13:13.590 --> 00:13:17.780
<i>But you have more talent than anyone knows what to do with.</i>

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:20.250
<i>I was mistaken.</i>

00:13:20.850 --> 00:13:23.030
<i>You'll continue to feel no empathy for other's pain,</i>

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:27.830
<i>you won't know the gratitude of working hard for something, and you'll lose your humanity.</i>

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:32.290
<i>Ryuuhei, what'll happen to you?</i>

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:35.280
<i>Stay conscious!</i>

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:38.130
<i>Take it... to him!</i>

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:43.720
Oh! It's the Dempsey Roll!

00:13:43.930 --> 00:13:46.140
Will he perish along with his beloved move?

00:13:46.140 --> 00:13:48.720
He's looking to die with honor!

00:13:49.480 --> 00:13:54.940
<i>The Dempsey Roll involves high-speed hitting from two blind spots.</i>

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:59.990
<i>You don't see those heavy blows coming, which makes it very frightening.</i>

00:14:00.550 --> 00:14:01.410
<i>But...</i>

00:14:04.770 --> 00:14:06.490
<i>if you step back just a little,</i>

00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:11.250
<i>you'll expose that move for just
 a bunch of normal hooks they are.</i>

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:13.000
<i>Is that where you are?</i>

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:16.250
<i>It can't work anymore, Makunouchi!</i>

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:21.050
<i>I wanted to savor you for the longest time,
 but if you're handing yourself on a silver platter...</i>

00:14:21.050 --> 00:14:23.760
<i>I'll just skewer you in one stroke!</i>

00:14:23.760 --> 00:14:26.560
<i>The Dempsey Crusher! He used his left last time...</i>

00:14:27.040 --> 00:14:28.770
<i>Now, he's using his Lightning Right!</i>

00:14:28.770 --> 00:14:30.890
<i>That's nothing like his left!</i>

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:32.270
<i>That right can actually kill you!</i>

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:35.360
<i>I don't care if he renders your move useless.</i>

00:14:35.360 --> 00:14:39.030
<i>If he knocks you out cold,
 you can always revive and try again.</i>

00:14:39.030 --> 00:14:42.280
<i>But what if the unthinkable happens?</i>

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:46.780
D-Don't!

00:14:51.250 --> 00:14:53.580
He lands a direct counter!

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:57.210
He entombs the Dempsey Roll once again!

00:14:57.210 --> 00:15:00.540
<i>He landed a full right! A deadly blow!</i>

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:01.470
<i>He might have even...</i>

00:15:02.690 --> 00:15:03.970
<i>killed you!</i>

00:15:05.260 --> 00:15:06.720
<i>Don't blame me, kid!</i>

00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:15.980
H-He's still up!

00:15:16.590 --> 00:15:21.360
He took a huge blow, yet he didn't go down!

00:15:21.990 --> 00:15:24.990
The challenger looks on, stunned!

00:15:24.990 --> 00:15:26.990
Th-That can't be!

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:30.990
<i>That punch was supposed to knock his lights out.</i>

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:33.750
<i>But he's still standing.</i>

00:15:34.640 --> 00:15:37.500
<i>He... knows about this counter!</i>

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:40.810
<i>He's been through it before!</i>

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:48.510
<i>If that was the first time, I wouldn't be standing.</i>

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:55.900
<i>The reason I'm still standing is, without doubt, because of Volg-san!</i>

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:04.680
<i>I can't let the help everyone gave me, and all the training I did go to waste!</i>

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:07.860
<i>No matter what happens to me, I won't lose!</i>

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:11.410
<i>I will win this fight!</i>

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:17.120
Whoa! The wounded champion isn't giving up!

00:16:17.690 --> 00:16:20.550
<i>I must put my belief into everything I've been taught up to now!</i>

00:16:20.550 --> 00:16:23.130
<i>Everything I learned I must put to practice!</i>

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:25.090
<i>You were just about done!</i>

00:16:25.090 --> 00:16:27.760
<i>Yet you still think you can beat me?</i>

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:29.640
Will he...

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:32.760
Will he come back unharmed?

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:37.440
He wasn't himself before this fight.

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:40.590
He was brooding way more than he usually does.

00:16:43.570 --> 00:16:48.650
<i>You're just squirming around like a worm, which is pissing me off!</i>

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:52.330
<i>No matter how tasty a slab of meat is, you'll puke if you eat too much of it!</i>

00:16:52.750 --> 00:16:54.690
Whoa! An elbow!

00:16:54.690 --> 00:16:58.240
He just dropped an elbow on the champion's back!

00:16:58.240 --> 00:16:59.420
What are you doing, Sawamura?!

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:01.210
Of course, that'll cost him a point!

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:04.210
Things are once again getting stormy in the ring!

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:05.800
Screw you, Sawamura!

00:17:05.800 --> 00:17:07.720
What do you think you're doing?!

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:10.060
<i>Are you stupid?</i>

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:12.510
<i>You were this close to becoming the champion.{being - becoming}</i>

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:15.720
<i>Now, even if you do win, you'll still be isolated.</i>

00:17:16.920 --> 00:17:18.650
<i>Your heart...</i>

00:17:18.650 --> 00:17:24.150
<i>will remain locked up in that{same} orphanage room.</i>

00:17:25.030 --> 00:17:26.940
<i>Go on, curse at me.</i>

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:29.430
<i>I don't need your cheers anyway.</i>

00:17:29.430 --> 00:17:34.780
<i>Grind your teeth as you see me win this fight.</i>

00:17:35.210 --> 00:17:37.760
You all right, Makunouchi? Can you fight?

00:17:38.860 --> 00:17:40.020
Yes.

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:43.790
The champion goes in!

00:17:44.650 --> 00:17:47.170
<i>I'm sick of eating your meat.</i>

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:48.300
<i>I'm done.</i>

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:51.810
<i>I'm going to... put you down.</i>

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:57.890
The challenger lands a barrage of hits!

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:03.960
<i>He’s unleashing the wild animal inside of him.</i>

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:07.150
<i>At this rate, no one can stop him.</i>

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:09.900
Coach! This is enough! The towel!

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:11.700
Throw in the towel!

00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:17.760
<i>He didn't fall because he was already aware of that counter.</i>

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:21.500
<i>And one more, there's one more reason...</i>

00:18:22.550 --> 00:18:26.040
<i>Kid. I'm counting on that reason!</i>

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:30.060
The champion's all but done for 
as he's being pummeled!

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:34.720
<i>You'll die. I'm going to kill you!</i>

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:37.850
<i>Where?</i>

00:18:40.560 --> 00:18:44.230
Whoa! Yet another Dempsey Roll!

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:47.940
The champion is definitely going down with his signature move!

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:50.870
<i>He's using that useless move again?</i>

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:53.990
<i>You want to die before facing me, Makunouchi?</i>

00:18:57.950 --> 00:18:58.620
Senpai!

00:18:58.630 --> 00:18:59.490
He's toast!

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:01.200
<i>Kid!</i>

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:03.210
<i>Your secret weapon?</i>

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:05.680
<i>It's just a stupid pendulum move.</i>

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:09.710
<i>Here you come. You're flying in like the fool you are.</i>

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:14.020
<i>Even a tough guy like you won't be able to stand after I split your cranium open.</i>

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:18.390
<i>I'm going to end your life with this powerful right!</i>

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:31.190
<i>I-Impossible!</i>

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:34.200
<i>He stopped?!</i>

00:19:34.710 --> 00:19:38.010
<i>C-Crap! I can't stop!</i>
